# Mostly unmodified upstream ClassicUO mirror (symlinks into external/ClassicUO) - ignored
# to avoid duplicating the submodule. The files negated below are real, MobileUO2-owned
# overrides (regular files, not symlinks) - tracked normally, no `git add -f` needed.
# IMPORTANT: never edit a file under this path while it's still a symlink - it writes
# through into external/ClassicUO (the upstream submodule, not ours to modify). Convert it
# to a real file first (rm the symlink, copy the content), then add a negation line below
# for both the .cs and its .meta so it stays a normal tracked file going forward.
#
# Recursive-ignore-with-explicit-allowlist pattern: `**` ignores the whole tree, the
# `**/` negation re-opens every directory purely for traversal (a dir being ignored
# blocks git from ever evaluating rules for anything inside it - the well-known
# "cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded" gitignore limitation),
# and only the specific files listed below are actually re-included.
Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/**
!Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/**/

!Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/CUOEnviroment.cs
!Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/CUOEnviroment.cs.meta
!Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/Client.cs
!Assets/Scripts/ClassicUO/src/Client.cs.meta
